From 785b4f218f2763dec558a62cc76fbd4004dfe65e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ultras <stavultras@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 16:03:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] net: add pcap backend; mt7981: NAND folder mask, Windows
 portability

- net/pcap.c: -netdev pcap,ifname=... attaches a NIC to a host adapter
  through libpcap/Npcap (loaded at run time), like a bridged adapter.
- spinand: partition files are any *mtdN* file ordered by N; positioned
  I/O without pread/pwrite and O_BINARY for Windows; ONFI parameter page.
- Wi-Fi, USB (xHCI + IPPC), EIP-97 id, pinctrl/EINT and board variants.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
